  "body": "## What changed\n\nClosing documentation pass for the v5.14.2 → v5.23.0 arc.\n\n- **README** — 27 → 54 model providers (intro + Features), Token optimizer (RTK) row, desktop & token-optimizer usage note.\n- **docs/USAGE.md** — 27/35 → 54 providers, Codex App catalog + RTK subsections.\n- **docs/BRAND.md** — three → four themes, add Velvet.\n- **ARCHITECTURE.md** — notes for `codex_catalog`, `config/desktop`, `config/rtk`, and the vertex/google_openai/openai adapters.\n- **In-dashboard Guide** — \"Desktop & token optimizer\" section.\n- **onboarding.py** — correct provider-step instructions + FCC → MCC.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Contract (`test_feature_manifest` + `test_docs_ui_labels`) + onboarding + brand tests: **53 passed**.\n- Full suite: **4106 passed / 6 failed** (6 = pre-existing PowerShell-installer baseline).\n\n## Notes\n\n- Docs/config-prose only — no version bump (no production behavior change).\n- Provider-table rows untouched (the `test_readme_provider_table_covers_full_catalog` contract enforces exact equality with the 54-provider catalog).\n- `CONTRIBUTING.md` and `.env.example` were verified and left as-is (already accurate).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
