    "message": "docs: comprehensive post-arc pass — providers, desktop, RTK, codex, deployment\n\nClosing documentation pass for the v5.14.2 → v5.23.0 arc. Fixes stale counts and\ndocuments the new surfaces.\n\n- README: 27 → 54 model providers (intro + Features), Token optimizer (RTK) row,\n  desktop & token-optimizer usage note.\n- docs/USAGE.md: 27/35 → 54 providers, Codex App catalog + RTK subsections.\n- docs/BRAND.md: three → four themes, add Velvet.\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: notes for codex_catalog, config/desktop, config/rtk, and the\n  vertex/google_openai/openai adapters.\n- In-dashboard Guide: \"Desktop & token optimizer\" section.\n- onboarding.py: correct provider-step instructions + FCC → MCC.\n\nVerification: contract + onboarding + brand tests pass; full suite 4106 passed /\n6 pre-existing PS-installer failures (baseline unchanged).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
